 "words": 115,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "When day came he called his disciples near",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He chose twelve of them to draw him near",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.51,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Simon whom he named the Cananaean",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Stood within the list of those chosen",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.89,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Gave them power over all demons there",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.98,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And authority to heal the pain",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Sent them out to proclaim the kingdom",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Of God and heal the sick again",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "In the upper room they gathered close",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.0,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "With one mind they devoted themselves to prayer",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.88,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Peter John and James and Andrew",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.87,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Philip Thomas Bartholomew and more",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.36,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Matthew James and Simon the Zealot",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.19,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And Judas son of James were there",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Mary the mother of Jesus too",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.42,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And his brothers joined in prayer",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.1,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Simon the Cananaean stands in the list",
   "heard": 7,
